Make prolonged Work1 and Work2 development safe by ensuring every authoritative release-cohort
registration remains durably visible and is selected by one later complete Work5 release.

## Desired Outcome

One local partition starts from all authoritative registrations, preserves document chain rollups,
represents document-free work as controlled Direct Work2 outcomes, retains exact totals under
bounding, and supplies consistent local status, hosted Overview, and Work/Awaiting Work5 views.
Fixed-width release tags resolve consistently, incorrect working-cohort anchors have an exact
append-only repair path, and release selection remains complete and anti-narrowing.

